    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d362">

                <pb facs="0600" n="500" xml:id="pg500"/>

                <head>No. 362.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Foster to Mr. Frelinghuysen.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1884-09-16"><hi rendition="#italic">September</hi> 16,
                        1884</date>. (Received September 29.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 264.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to your instructions Nos. 184 and
                    220, I have now to inclose herewith, for your information, a copy of my note of
                    the 11th instant to the minister of state, renewing the request for the return
                    of the so called cattle tax collected by the Spanish consul at Key West.</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>JOHN W. FOSTER.</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d362-a1.xml" xpointer="d362-a1"/>
            </div>
